@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 42
title SA-RV02 — review and change-impact route
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Identify changed authoritative source\nRetain accepted decisions and prior snapshot" as Change
rectangle "Locate affected candidate/model/operation context\nUse matrices as associations, not automatic coverage" as Impact
rectangle "Recheck local identities and structural consistency\nThen inspect exact semantic cases / unresolved policy" as Review
rectangle "Identify updated candidate and scoped gates\nRecord actual reviewer/owner disposition when it occurs" as Record
Change --> Impact
Impact --> Review
Review --> Record
Review ..> Impact : affected gap / refinement
note bottom of Record
No automatic RF/Q-D closure or baseline acceptance.
Future code/product results need actual evidence.
No requirement to repeat already accepted choices.
end note

@enduml
